1
00:00:00,472 --> 00:00:03,672
(Amy:)No one's talking
about Sonny and Cher.

2
00:00:03,675 --> 00:00:05,705
(Sheldon:)You must be thinking
about Donny and Marie,

3
00:00:05,711 --> 00:00:08,341
(Sheldon:)'cause you and I are clearly
talking about Sonny and Cher.

4
00:00:09,781 --> 00:00:11,511
(Amy:)Sheldon, this has to stop.

5
00:00:11,517 --> 00:00:13,087
(Amy:)I know it's hard.

6
00:00:13,085 --> 00:00:14,785
(Amy:)It's hard for me, too.

7
00:00:14,786 --> 00:00:16,686
(Amy:)But I've seen
and talked to you more

8
00:00:16,688 --> 00:00:18,218
(Amy:)in the two days
we've been broken up

9
00:00:18,223 --> 00:00:20,923
(Amy:)than in the last two months
that we were together.

10
00:00:20,926 --> 00:00:22,596
(Sheldon:)Well, if you want
to see less of me,

11
00:00:22,594 --> 00:00:25,424
(Sheldon:)maybe we should go out again.

12
00:00:26,598 --> 00:00:28,768
(Raj:)I can't believe you made out
with Mandy Chao.

13
00:00:28,767 --> 00:00:30,797
(Leonard:)Trust me,
I wish it never happened.

14
00:00:30,802 --> 00:00:33,202
(Raj:)And you knew about this
this whole time?

15
00:00:33,205 --> 00:00:34,405
(Howard:)I did.

16
00:00:34,406 --> 00:00:36,436
(Raj:)And you didn't think to tell me?

17
00:00:38,043 --> 00:00:40,373
(Howard:)Leonard asked me
to keep it to myself.

18
00:00:40,379 --> 00:00:42,709
(Raj:)Let's leave Leonard
out of this for the moment.

19
00:00:43,982 --> 00:00:46,512
(Raj:)This is about you and me.

20
00:00:47,886 --> 00:00:50,586
(Leonard:)Wait, wait, wait, how is my
day-old marriage falling apart

21
00:00:50,589 --> 00:00:51,689
(Leonard:)becoming about you two?

22
00:00:51,690 --> 00:00:52,860
(Raj:)Hang on.

23
00:00:52,858 --> 00:00:55,558
(Raj:)What do I need to do
to make you trust me?

24
00:00:55,561 --> 00:00:57,531
(Howard:)You think it's hard
having one wife,

25
00:00:57,529 --> 00:01:00,019
(Howard:)try having two.

